%% ============================================================
%%  EDU System – Timing Diagram
%%  Full student journey from registration to acceptance
%% ============================================================
timeline
    title EDU Platform – Student Journey Timeline

    section 🔐 Day 1 – Registration & Profile Setup
        T+0min  : Student opens EDU portal
                : System serves landing page (CDN)
        T+2min  : Student fills registration form
                : Auth Service creates account & sends verification email
        T+5min  : Student verifies email ✅
                : JWT session token issued
        T+10min : Student selects school type
                : (Public / American / Private branch selected)
        T+15min : Student enters academic grades & results
                : Profile Service validates data format
        T+25min : Student uploads transcripts & certificates
                : Documents stored in S3 – queued for verification
        T+30min : Academic profile marked "Complete" ✅

    section 🔍 Day 1 – University Search & Matching
        T+31min : Student triggers "Find Universities"
                : Search & Match Service runs eligibility algorithm
        T+32min : Elasticsearch queries university index
                : Ranked match list returned (top 10 universities)
        T+33min : Student sees matched universities sorted by fit score
        T+40min : Student applies filters (Location=Cairo, Fees<50k)
                : Filtered results updated in real time (Redis cached)
        T+45min : Student opens University profile page
                : University details, programs, fees, location loaded

    section 💬 Day 1 – Chat Interaction
        T+50min  : Student clicks "Chat with University"
                 : Chat session created (Socket.IO)
        T+51min  : Student sends "What are the Engineering fees?"
                 : FAQ Bot checks knowledge base – no exact match
        T+52min  : Message forwarded to University Rep (push notification)
        T+55min  : Rep replies "Engineering fees are EGP 45,000/year"
                 : Message delivered to student in real time ✅
        T+57min  : Student asks "Where is the campus?"
        T+58min  : Rep sends campus location with Google Maps link ✅
        T+60min  : Chat closed – student satisfied

    section 📝 Day 2 – Application Submission
        T+1440min : Student returns to EDU portal next day
                  : Session restored from Redis cache
        T+1445min : Student clicks "Apply Now" on saved university
                  : Application Service pre-fills form from profile
        T+1450min : Student reviews and confirms application
                  : Application submitted to university ✅
        T+1451min : Notification Service sends confirmation email
                  : SMS confirmation sent to student's phone
        T+1452min : University Rep receives new application alert

    section ✅ Day 7-14 – Review & Decision
        T+10080min : University Rep reviews application
                   : Student profile & documents checked
        T+14400min : Additional documents requested (if needed)
                   : Student notified via email + app notification
        T+15000min : Student uploads requested documents
        T+20160min : Application reviewed again
                   : Admin approves admission decision
        T+20161min : Student receives acceptance email 🎉
                   : Enrollment confirmation link sent
        T+20200min : Student accepts offer
                   : Enrolled status set ✅ – Journey complete
